        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "We may observe that in the earlier times such fairs/festivals were traditionally organized in the local areas in small proportions during festive seasons, however, over the years the magnitude of these fairs, which used to be small and mana"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "f5ba0b566ec14a8ebf3d88ac85be16ff_16",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Also, the numbers of people visiting such fairs have exponentially increased."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "be4509f65ff6485e8c89eb786b38deb2_17",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "6. In our opinion, such changed scenario of these fairs would certainly involve better control,\nadministration and management, inasmuch as, there would be serious issues of safety of the visitors from the point of view of children / visitor"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "ae34cad25c39479090dc88bcc830d82d_18",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Also there would be 31 January, 2024 914.WPL3364_2024.DOC concerns of safety of food available at the stalls, which may be large in number."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "31e49b78f1e4438194108eb8e14196a3_19",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "There would also be issues of over crowding, fire, hygiene, noise pollution and other disturbances adversely affecting the peaceful living of the residents in the vicinity, as contended by the petitioner which itself would be a fundamental "
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "13f576dffccf44e9b291b0e2b198a7fe_20",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "7. Thus, what would be the nature of the administration, management and control of such fairs /\nevents at the hands of the authorities like the Municipal Corporation, State Government, Police Authorities and any other authorities on such is"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "7c5125791e974126b5d025afe7e19e79_21",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "large mechanical equipments at the \"fun fair\", would be a matter of serious concern."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "e5e7390ed48d42d98d74cb70ac077b04_22",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "8. There is another concern, namely, as to whether some public lanes, roads which are not designated places for large \"fun fairs\" or any recreational activity of such nature, can at all be permitted to be used for such large fairs and event"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "30379fb3fc3944f88f9abb10a9fdc2c4_23",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "As to what would be the regime of such safeguards would also be required to be specified and known to the public at large."
      },
      {
